{"name":"Cute Little Pink","hex":"#f4e2e1","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cute","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Possessing physical features, behaviors, personality traits or other properties that are mainly attributed to infants and small or cuddly animals; e.g. fair, dainty, round, and soft physical features, disproportionately large eyes and head, playfulness, fragility, helplessness, curiosity or shyness, innocence, affectionate behavior.","Lovable, charming, attractive or pleasing, especially in a youthful, dainty, quaint or fun-spirited way."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cute"},{"term":"little","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Small, not large, limited, particularly.","Small, limited in size."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Not much.","Not at all."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/little"},{"term":"pink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color reminiscent of pinks, the flowers.","Magenta, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a colour between red and white; pale red.","Of a fox-hunter's jacket: scarlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Little Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Little Pink is a term used to describe Chinese nationalists on the internet. They are primarily active on Chinese social media, with some active on social media sites blocked in China such as Facebook, Twitter, and Instagram. The term originated in 2008 to describe predominantly young female nationalists in internet fandom subcultures. After 2015, it became more broadly applied regardless of gender."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little_Pink","wikidata":"Q28413731"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower. It was first used as a color name in the late 17th century. A combination of pink and white is associated with innocence, whereas a combination of pink and black links to eroticism and seduction."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/330px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink","wikidata":"Q429220"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/500px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/500px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APink_sapphire_ring.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Burano_Hausfassade_W%C3%A4sche-20090315-RM-113043.jpg/500px-Burano_Hausfassade_W%C3%A4sche-20090315-RM-113043.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Burano_Hausfassade_W%C3%A4sche-20090315-RM-113043.jpg/500px-Burano_Hausfassade_W%C3%A4sche-20090315-RM-113043.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABurano_Hausfassade_W%C3%A4sche-20090315-RM-113043.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Cherry_Blossom_Spring_Sky_%284531848988%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Cherry_Blossom_Spring_Sky_%284531848988%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Cherry_Blossom_Spring_Sky_%284531848988%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Cherry_Blossom_Spring_Sky_%284531848988%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.w